# Brewfile for the 'cursor' profile — the Cursor editor.
#
# Split out of the core tier's old AI slot, which carried `cask 'cursor'`
# commented out while unconditionally running the Cursor extension install
# for every host. Both now live in this one profile: opt in and you get the
# editor plus its extensions; leave it out and neither runs.

# Casks
cask 'cursor'
